{"2177940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Odania Sports Arena", "steam_appid": 2177940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/361dd4e3ad35cf6c9d4f0ae8aa7941e6.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/361dd4e3ad35cf6c9d4f0ae8aa7941e6.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Odania Sports Arena, where sci-fi sports and VR come together for a high-energy, immersive experience. With intuitive motion controls, every punch, swing, and throw in this futuristic arena feels like the real deal. Whether you’re boxing in zero gravity, swinging a club in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space golf, or trying your hand at space ball, each mode brings its own exciting challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/a29ec294ebf8eb1a07ae5dc4731a3c3a.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/a29ec294ebf8eb1a07ae5dc4731a3c3a.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of different sports, each offering a unique take on their classic versions. From boxing in a rhythm-like style, to swinging a bat at incoming targets, or even just golfing in space - every mode is designed to test your skills in different ways. With five unique game modes to choose from, there’s a ton of fun to be had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/0db27f40dc00f9e9b49d243d941c47cb.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/0db27f40dc00f9e9b49d243d941c47cb.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odania Sports Arena is focused on accessibility with simple controls and gameplay mechanics that allow anyone to dive into the fun right away. Despite being easy to learn, the skill ceiling is high, and mastering each game mode requires sharp reflexes, timing, and strategy. Hone your skills as you rise to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/d2fb682230fdfb448f8ff3c4a641be01.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/d2fb682230fdfb448f8ff3c4a641be01.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Different Space-Themed Sports</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive VR Sci-Fi Arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Realistic Controls and Game Feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy To Learn, Hard to Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customizable Game Settings</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/361dd4e3ad35cf6c9d4f0ae8aa7941e6.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/361dd4e3ad35cf6c9d4f0ae8aa7941e6.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Odania Sports Arena, where sci-fi sports and VR come together for a high-energy, immersive experience. With intuitive motion controls, every punch, swing, and throw in this futuristic arena feels like the real deal. Whether you’re boxing in zero gravity, swinging a club in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space golf, or trying your hand at space ball, each mode brings its own exciting challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/a29ec294ebf8eb1a07ae5dc4731a3c3a.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/a29ec294ebf8eb1a07ae5dc4731a3c3a.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of different sports, each offering a unique take on their classic versions. From boxing in a rhythm-like style, to swinging a bat at incoming targets, or even just golfing in space - every mode is designed to test your skills in different ways. With five unique game modes to choose from, there’s a ton of fun to be had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/0db27f40dc00f9e9b49d243d941c47cb.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/0db27f40dc00f9e9b49d243d941c47cb.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odania Sports Arena is focused on accessibility with simple controls and gameplay mechanics that allow anyone to dive into the fun right away. Despite being easy to learn, the skill ceiling is high, and mastering each game mode requires sharp reflexes, timing, and strategy. Hone your skills as you rise to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras/d2fb682230fdfb448f8ff3c4a641be01.avif?t=1757657225\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/extras_big/d2fb682230fdfb448f8ff3c4a641be01.avif?t=1757657225 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Different Space-Themed Sports</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive VR Sci-Fi Arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Realistic Controls and Game Feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy To Learn, Hard to Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customizable Game Settings</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Enter the Odania Sports Arena, an easy-to-play VR experience where you compete in fun sci-fi-themed sports events. Master five different games, from boxing to space golf, as you try to beat the highest score.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/58d2dbde3802cc14243f5685754357d166faac9c/header.jpg?t=1757657225", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/4ce06eb4723e2174939ee2a06869bee95ce08054/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757657225", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2177940/4ce06eb4723e2174939ee2a06869bee95ce08054/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757657225", "website": "https://protectors-of-balance.com/games/odania-sports-arena/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-459